              </div>
              <div class="review-text">Rated 4.99/5 Online</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card-block">
            <div class="story-image-block"><img src="/images/story-image.webp" loading="lazy" alt="story-image" class="story-image"></div>
            <div class="about-card-content-block">
              <div class="counter-number-wrap">
                <div class="counter-number-block-two up">
                  <h2 class="counter-number is-white">100+</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="body-text-main text-color-white">Clients Across diverse goals and backgrounds</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div scroll="scroll interaction" class="story-content-right">
          <div class="story-details-block">
            <p class="story-details-text">Every successful transformation begins with a well-defined decision. My mission is to guide you through this process, ensuring that you feel confident and have a clear sense of direction as you navigate the changes ahead. Together, we will explore your options and make informed choices that align with your goals.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="story-counter-block">
            <div scroll="scroll interaction" class="story-counter-wrap">
              <div class="counter-card">
                <div class="counter-text-wrap">
                  <p class="counter-text">Trusted Industry Experience</p>
                </div>
                <div class="counter-number-wrapper">
                  <div class="counter-number-wrap">
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two up">
                      <h2 class="counter-number _wf-counter">1</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two">
                      <h2 class="industries-text">+years</h2>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="counter-card">
                <div class="counter-text-wrap">
                  <p class="counter-text">Professionals Guided Successfully Client</p>
                </div>
                <div class="counter-number-wrapper">
                  <div class="counter-number-wrap">
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two up">
                      <h2 class="counter-number _wf-counter">12</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two up">
                      <h2 class="industries-text">K</h2>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="counter-card">
                <div class="counter-text-wrap">
                  <p class="counter-text">Satisfaction High Client Retention Rate</p>
                </div>
                <div class="counter-number-wrapper">
                  <div class="counter-number-wrap">
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two up">
                      <h2 class="counter-number _wf-counter">96</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two">
                      <h2 class="industries-text">%</h2>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="counter-card">
                <div class="counter-text-wrap">
                  <p class="counter-text">Diverse Experience Across Fields</p>
                </div>
                <div class="counter-number-wrapper">
                  <div class="counter-number-wrap">
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two up">
                      <h2 class="counter-number _wf-counter">10</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="counter-number-block-two">
                      <h2 class="industries-text">+Industries</h2>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
